			},
			"description": "Color separation \/ misregistered print: splits the image by brightness into three colour bands (dark, mid, light) like an early two-colour film print or Len Lye's Rainbow Dance. At rest (Misregistration Amount 0) the bands sit on top of each other. Animate Misregistration Amount (px) for the drift (e.g. on the kick) and Misregistration Angle (°) slowly for the direction. Source Opacity and Color Bands Opacity mix original and bands independently.",
